%N A399057 Denominators of Sum_{k=1..n} n^2/(k^2 + (n-k)^2).
%H A399057 Ginés Pérez Teruel, <a href="https://periodicos.uem.br/ojs/index.php/BSocParanMat/article/view/78986">A Diophantine Identity of Sophie Germain Type and a Telescoping Family of Series with Zeta Asymptotics</a>, Bol. Soc. Paran. Mat. (3s.), 44 (2026), no. 6, 1-16.
%F A399057 a(n) = denominator(Sum_{k=1..n} n^2/(k^2 + (n-k)^2)).
%e A399057 1/1, 3/1, 23/5, 31/5, 1721/221, 609/65, ...
%t A399057 a[n_] := Denominator[Together[Sum[n^2/(k^2 + (n - k)^2), {k, 1, n}]]]
